{"added":{"value":"2026-09-24"},"brand":{"value":"Volt"},"data_sources":{"value":{"manufacturer_datasheet":"https://voltloudspeakers.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/VM754_v1.1.pdf","manufacturer_product_page":"https://voltloudspeakers.co.uk/speaker/vm754/"}},"description":{"value":"This 3\" (75 mm) soft midrange dome developed for studio monitors that demand accuracy, power, and effortless midband clarity. Loaded by a short, front-mounted horn, it delivers exceptionally smooth frequency response and the controlled dispersion required for precise imaging in critical listening environments. A lightweight, single-layer copper voice coil-wound on a former slightly longer than the focused magnet gap-allows generous excursion at the lower end of the operating range while maintaining detail and control. The one-piece fabric dome and surround are coated for consistency and low coloration, with a secondary rear surround ensuring full coil stability under dynamic conditions. The FEA-optimised magnet assembly uses a substantial 155 mm ceramic magnet to achieve high efficiency and dependable thermal performance. The structure is mounted to a rigid, painted aluminium chassis, and termination braids are hidden inside the unit keeping the design clean. Standard 4.8 mm spade terminals accept soldered or push-on connectors. For serviceability, the dome and coil are built onto a precisely locating, replaceable diaphragm ring for straightforward field replacement. The VM754 is designed for rear mounting, with M5 threaded inserts incorporated into the flange for secure, reliable installation."},"driver_type":{"value":["midrange"]},"manufacturer":{"value":"Volt"},"model":{"value":"VM754"},"product_image":{"value":"https://voltloudspeakers.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/volt-land1.jpg"},"provided_by":{"value":"OpenIsd"},"quality":{"invalid":[],"parse_errors":["Rms_kg_per_s='0.0 Ohm - m' (Ohm - m): unit 'Ohm - m' (normalised 'ohm-m') not recognised for field 'Rms_kg_per_s'; if the source really prints